OL,3,GNEWSATeacher banned over late-night
OL,4,Amessages to pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher who sent more than 160
OL,7,FWhatsApp messages to a pupil has been
OL,8,Fbanned from the profession.
OL,10,FRichard Hill, a former science teacher
OL,11,Fat Trafalgar School in Portsmouth,
OL,12,Fexchanged emails and messages with the
OL,13,Fgirl over a two week period in June
OL,14,F2024, some of which she said made her
OL,15,Ffeel "uncomfortable".
OL,17,FA Teaching Regulation Agency (TRA)
OL,18,Fpanel deemed the messages
OL,19,Funprofessional and over-familiar, but
OL,20,Fsaid there was no evidence they were
OL,21,Fsexually motivated.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
