OL,4,Amessages to pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FHill, in a written response, described
OL,7,Fhis conduct as "a poor lapse in
OL,8,Fjudgement" and said he deeply regretted
OL,9,Fnot raising it with senior leaders at
OL,10,Fthe earliest opportunity.
